    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >n this game you'll explore colorful city streets on the eve of the Day of the Dead, unique jungle landscapes and ancient temples of a lost civilization. You'll even get a chance to look inside one of the pyramids. All along the way you will have to find 590 hidden objects, so that the black-and-white world will be painted in color and come to life. You decide what items you want to find! Between levels you will find interesting puzzles. Enjoy the game with atmospheric music. Suitable for the whole family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:<br>- 590 different items to look for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 different mini games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Option to choose the item you want to search for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increasing level of difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There is a hint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interactivity. Items can also be searched inside buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The world is populated by inhabitants, each one has a story to tell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Coloring levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2.5D effect<br><br><i>Artist:\u00a0Anikeyra</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >n this game you'll explore colorful city streets on the eve of the Day of the Dead, unique jungle landscapes and ancient temples of a lost civilization. You'll even get a chance to look inside one of the pyramids. All along the way you will have to find 590 hidden objects, so that the black-and-white world will be painted in color and come to life. You decide what items you want to find! Between levels you will find interesting puzzles. Enjoy the game with atmospheric music. Suitable for the whole family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:<br>- 590 different items to look for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3 different mini games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Option to choose the item you want to search for</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increasing level of difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- There is a hint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interactivity. Items can also be searched inside buildings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The world is populated by inhabitants, each one has a story to tell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Coloring levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2.5D effect<br><br><i>Artist:\u00a0Anikeyra</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Immerse yourself in an exciting adventure in Find All 8: The road to the Maya. You will have to explore colorful city streets, unique jungle views and ancient temples of a lost civilization. Look for hidden objects and color this mysterious painted world.",
